1 REM FBCS ARR-0104
2 REM CLAIM A-7.1.4-04
3 REM TYPE SELF
100 PRINT "ARR-0104 MAXSIZE AFTER MAT A = B (7.1.4)"
110 DIM A(10), B(2)
